      "content": "The transition to renewables is a done deal, but it absolutely does not mean the economic fallout for fossil fuel-dependent regions is irrelevant; in fact, the speed of this shift is creating a massive, urgent crisis for those communities. Ignoring the human cost of energy poverty and the collapse of traditional industries is a dangerous strategy that will only deepen social instability and political backlash. We must address these human and economic realities with targeted support and retraining programs, because a transition that leaves people behind is not a success, no matter how clean the energy is.",
